---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Terms of Use | Tank & Trench";
const pageDesc = "Terms of Use for tankandtrench.com, operated by Shellback Labs LLC, doing business as Tank & Trench. Effective date: November 13, 2026.";
---
<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDesc}>
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="eyebrow cobalt" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="display-lg" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
        Terms of Use
      </h1>
      <p class="body-sm" style="color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-bottom: 36px;">
        Effective date: November 13, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="legal-content-flow">
        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-900);">
          These terms cover your use of tankandtrench.com, run by Shellback Labs LLC, doing business as Tank &amp; Trench (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us&rdquo;). By using the site, you agree with them.
        </p>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Who the site is for</h2>
          <p>
            This site is for businesses, mainly septic and excavation companies. It is not intended for consumers or for anyone under 18.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Free AI checks and check pages</h2>
          <p>
            Our free AI checks and personal check pages show what an AI assistant or search engine returned for a specific question on a specific date. AI answers change by day, wording and location, so you may get a different answer when you ask. A check reflects only what we saw on the date shown. It is not a judgment of any company&rsquo;s quality, licensing or work, and it is provided for information only.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">No guaranteed results</h2>
          <p>
            We do not promise any search ranking, any mention in an AI answer, or any number of calls or customers. Search engines and AI providers control their own results.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Paid services</h2>
          <p>
            Paid services are covered by a separate written agreement between you and us. If that agreement and these terms conflict, the agreement controls. Prices shown on the site may change, but never for a signed agreement during its term.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Other companies&rsquo; names and trademarks</h2>
          <p>
            Check pages and postcards may show names of other businesses and AI products (such as ChatGPT) because they appeared in an AI answer. Those names belong to their owners. Showing them does not mean those companies are affiliated with us or endorse us. If you think something we show about your business is wrong, email us and we will review it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">What you send us</h2>
          <p>
            When you submit a form, you confirm the information is accurate and that you are allowed to share it. You agree that we may contact you about your request, as described in our Privacy Policy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Calls and text messaging</h2>
          <p>
            If you provide your phone number to Tank &amp; Trench, you agree that Shellback Labs LLC d/b/a Tank &amp; Trench may call or send SMS/MMS text messages regarding your request, check page, or account. You can contact us or get help by calling or texting <strong>(617) 579-8197</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of purchasing any services. Message and data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. You may unsubscribe or opt out at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any text message. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or email <a href="mailto:joe@tankandtrench.com" style="color: var(--cobalt-600); text-decoration: none;">joe@tankandtrench.com</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            For information on how we handle and protect your personal information, please view our <a href="/privacy/" style="color: var(--cobalt-600); text-decoration: underline;">Privacy Policy</a>. Mobile information will not be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Our content</h2>
          <p>
            The site&rsquo;s text, design and materials belong to us. You may view and share pages for your own business use, but you may not copy, resell or republish them without our permission.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Acceptable use</h2>
          <p>
            Don&rsquo;t use the site to break the law, send spam or harmful code, scrape it in bulk, or interfere with how it works.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Links to other sites</h2>
          <p>
            The site may link to other websites. We don&rsquo;t control them and aren&rsquo;t responsible for their content.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            The site and free checks are provided &ldquo;as is,&rdquo; without warranties of any kind, to the extent the law allows.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect, incidental or lost-profit damages arising from your use of the site. Our total liability for any claim about the site or free checks is limited to $100. Paid services are governed by their own agreement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Governing law</h2>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Rhode Island. Any dispute will be handled in the state or federal courts located in Rhode Island.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p>
            If we change these terms, we will post the new version here and update the effective date.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section-block">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">Contact</h2>
          <div class="contact-card-box">
            <div><strong style="color: var(--ink-900);">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:joe@tankandtrench.com" style="color: var(--cobalt-600); text-decoration: none;">joe@tankandtrench.com</a></div>
            <div><strong style="color: var(--ink-900);">Address:</strong> Shellback Labs LLC, PO Box 431, Westerly, RI 02891</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
